---
// 비교 글의 "선택지 × 기준" 표. 넓으면 가로 스크롤(base.css .table-scroll)
export interface Props {
  caption: string;
  options: string[];
  rows: { label: string; values: string[] }[];
}

const { caption, options, rows } = Astro.props;
---

<div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label={caption}>
  <table class="compare-table">
    <caption>{caption}</caption>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th scope="col">기준</th>
        {options.map((o) => <th scope="col">{o}</th>)}
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {
        rows.map((r) => (
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">{r.label}</th>
            {r.values.map((v) => <td>{v}</td>)}
          </tr>
        ))
      }
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<style>
  tbody th {
    font-weight: var(--weight-semibold);
  }
</style>
